{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p></p>\n<p>天文台於今日（11月13日）下午開始預測本港天氣將有顯著變化，隨著高空擾動靠近，預料會逐漸出現幾陣驟雨，晚上驟雨增多並伴隨狂風雷暴，風勢亦會增強。明日（11月14日）初時雨勢可能頗大，市民需提高警覺，避免前往易受天氣影響的地區。\n</p>\n<p>天文台提醒市民密切留意最新天氣消息，尤其是計劃進行戶外活動時，應時刻注意天氣變化並做好防雨及防風措施。隨著高空擾動逐漸遠離，明日白天驟雨將減少，天色有望好轉，下午部分時間可能會有陽光。</p>\n<p>市民在此期間應保持警惕，避免在雷暴期間進行戶外活動，並確保家中窗戶及物品固定妥當，以減少強風可能帶來的損害。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%a4%a9%e6%96%87%e5%8f%b0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">天文台</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%89%b9%e5%88%a5%e5%a4%a9%e6%b0%a3%e6%8f%90%e7%a4%ba/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">特別天氣提示</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%a9%9f%e9%9b%a8%e9%9b%b7%e6%9a%b4/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">驟雨雷暴</a> </p>\n<p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生活</a>\nNov 13 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T16:44:21.779955+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":300,"images":0,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T16:30:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T17:57:47.916492+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T16:37:47.343133+00:00","content_hash":"02f647d9bc3b7e466ef742c68a7866cb106e7a1ea5ea62b366aa72ca11a3825b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}